**Version**: 2.0 (Post Full Normalization)  
**Database**: MySQL 10.4+ (absenta13)  
**Backend**: server_modern.js (7200+ lines)  
**Frontend**: React + TypeScript + Vite  
**Status**: ✅ **PRODUCTION READY**

### ✅ Completed Features
