## 🔑 CRITICAL PATTERNS

### **1. Multi-Guru Query** ⭐ ALWAYS USE
```sql
-- Get teacher's schedules (primary + additional)
SELECT j.* 
FROM jadwal j
LEFT JOIN jadwal_guru jg ON j.id_jadwal = jg.jadwal_id 
  AND jg.guru_id = ? AND jg.status = 'aktif'
WHERE (j.guru_id = ? OR jg.guru_id IS NOT NULL) 
  AND j.status = 'aktif'
```

### **2. Siswa with Nullable User** ⚠️ CRITICAL
```sql
-- ALWAYS use LEFT JOIN for user_id
SELECT s.*, u.username, u.email, u.status as user_status
FROM siswa s
LEFT JOIN users u ON s.user_id = u.id
WHERE s.id_siswa = ?
```

### **3. Transaction Pattern** ✅ REQUIRED
```javascript
let connection;
try {
  connection = await db.getConnection();
  await connection.beginTransaction();
  
  // Multiple operations
  await connection.execute('INSERT INTO users ...', []);
  await connection.execute('INSERT INTO siswa ...', []);
  
  await connection.commit();
} catch (error) {
  if (connection) await connection.rollback();
  throw error;
} finally {
  if (connection) connection.release();
}
```

### **4. Smart Delete Pattern** (Preserve History)
```javascript
// Check if student has attendance records
const [attendance] = await connection.execute(
  'SELECT COUNT(*) as count FROM absensi_siswa WHERE siswa_id = ?',
  [siswaId]
);

if (attendance[0].count > 0) {
  // Soft delete - deactivate
  await connection.execute('UPDATE users SET status = "tidak_aktif" WHERE id = ?', [userId]);
  await connection.execute('UPDATE siswa SET status = "tidak_aktif" WHERE id_siswa = ?', [siswaId]);
} else {
  // Hard delete - no history
  await connection.execute('DELETE FROM siswa WHERE id_siswa = ?', [siswaId]);
  await connection.execute('DELETE FROM users WHERE id = ?', [userId]);
}
```

### **5. Daily Attendance Logic** ⭐ EXPORT SYSTEM
```sql
-- Priority-based daily status aggregation
WITH daily_status AS (
    SELECT 
        s.id_siswa, s.nama, ase.tanggal,
        CASE 
            -- Alpha → Tidak Hadir (highest priority)
            WHEN SUM(CASE WHEN ase.status = 'Alpa' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) > 0 
                THEN 'Alpa'
            -- Dispen → Hadir (belajar bentuk lain)
            WHEN SUM(CASE WHEN ase.status = 'Dispen' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) = COUNT(*) 
                THEN 'Dispen'
            -- Izin/Sakit → Hadir dengan status
            WHEN SUM(CASE WHEN ase.status IN ('Izin','Sakit') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) = COUNT(*) 
                THEN 'Izin'
            -- Hadir
            WHEN SUM(CASE WHEN ase.status = 'Hadir' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) > 0 
                THEN 'Hadir'
            ELSE 'Alpa'
        END as status_hari
    FROM siswa s
    LEFT JOIN absensi_siswa ase ON s.id_siswa = ase.siswa_id 
    GROUP BY s.id_siswa, s.nama, ase.tanggal
)
SELECT 
    nama,
    SUM(CASE WHEN status_hari = 'Hadir' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as hadir,
    SUM(CASE WHEN status_hari = 'Dispen' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as dispen,
    COUNT(DISTINCT tanggal) as total_hari
FROM daily_status
WHERE tanggal IS NOT NULL
GROUP BY nama
```

