## 🚨 COMMON MISTAKES - JANGAN LAKUKAN INI!

### ❌ WRONG: Direct siswa_perwakilan reference
```sql
-- JANGAN:
SELECT * FROM siswa_perwakilan WHERE id_siswa = ?;

-- BENAR:
SELECT * FROM siswa WHERE id_siswa = ?;
```

### ❌ WRONG: Assume user_id NOT NULL
```javascript
// JANGAN:
const [siswa] = await db.execute('SELECT * FROM siswa WHERE user_id = ?', [userId]);

// BENAR:
const [siswa] = await db.execute(
  'SELECT s.*, u.* FROM siswa s LEFT JOIN users u ON s.user_id = u.id WHERE s.id_siswa = ?',
  [siswaId]
);
```

### ❌ WRONG: Multi-table operation without transaction
```javascript
// JANGAN:
await db.execute('INSERT INTO users ...', []);
await db.execute('INSERT INTO siswa ...', []); // BERBAHAYA jika gagal!

// BENAR:
const connection = await db.getConnection();
await connection.beginTransaction();
try {
  await connection.execute('INSERT INTO users ...', []);
  await connection.execute('INSERT INTO siswa ...', []);
  await connection.commit();
} catch (error) {
  await connection.rollback();
  throw error;
} finally {
  connection.release();
}
```

### ❌ WRONG: Forget multi-guru in schedule query
```sql
-- JANGAN (only primary teacher):
SELECT * FROM jadwal WHERE guru_id = ?;

-- BENAR (primary + additional teachers):
SELECT j.* FROM jadwal j
LEFT JOIN jadwal_guru jg ON j.id_jadwal = jg.jadwal_id AND jg.guru_id = ?
WHERE j.guru_id = ? OR jg.guru_id IS NOT NULL;
```

