## 📱 API ENDPOINTS STRUCTURE

### **Authentication**
- `POST /api/login` - Support role 'SISWA'
- `POST /api/logout` - Clear session

### **Admin** (Role: admin)
- `GET /api/admin/users` - All users with pagination
- `POST /api/admin/siswa` - Create student + user (transaction)
- `PUT /api/admin/students/:id` - Update student + user (transaction)
- `DELETE /api/admin/students/:id` - Smart delete (preserve history)
- `GET /api/admin/guru` - All teachers
- `POST /api/admin/guru` - Create teacher + user (transaction)
- `GET /api/admin/jadwal` - All schedules
- `POST /api/admin/jadwal` - Create schedule + multi-guru

### **Guru** (Role: guru)
- `GET /api/guru/jadwal` - Schedules (primary + additional)
- `GET /api/guru/kelas` - Assigned classes
- `POST /api/guru/absensi` - Record attendance (multi-guru)
- `GET /api/guru/banding` - Banding list (multi-guru)
- `PUT /api/guru/banding/:id` - Respond to banding

### **Siswa** (Role: siswa)
- `GET /api/siswa/profile` - Student profile
- `GET /api/siswa/jadwal` - Class schedule
- `POST /api/siswa/kehadiran-guru` - Submit teacher attendance
- `POST /api/siswa/banding` - Submit individual/class banding
- `GET /api/siswa/banding` - Banding history

### **Export** (Role: admin)
- `GET /api/export/teacher-summary` - Teacher attendance summary
- `GET /api/export/student-summary` - Student attendance summary
- `GET /api/export/presensi-siswa` - Student detailed attendance
- `GET /api/export/rekap-ketidakhadiran` - Student absence recap
- `GET /api/export/rekap-ketidakhadiran-guru` - Teacher absence recap
- `GET /api/export/banding-absen` - Banding history

